OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786493896
OL,3,CCheshire mum gave up smoking for a
OL,4,Chealthier family during prenancy
OL,6,FMia Rogerson tells ITV Granada
OL,7,Fjournalist Zoe Muldoon how she managed
OL,8,Fto stop smoking when pregnant with
OL,9,Fhelp from the NHS.
OL,11,FA mum from Cheshire who stopped
OL,12,Fsmoking when she became pregnant with
OL,13,Fher first child is urging others to
OL,14,Fquit the habit for good.
OL,16,FMia Rogerson, from Middlewich, who
OL,17,Fused to smoke 15 cigarettes a day,
OL,18,Fsays she knew she had to give up for
OL,19,Fgood after learning she was expecting.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
