CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786493896
OL,3,CCheshire mum gave up smoking for a
OL,4,Chealthier family during prenancy
OL,6,FShe said: "I was quite a heavy smoker,
OL,7,Fto be fair. I'd have five cigarettes
OL,8,Fin the first hour I woke up,"
OL,10,F"But I was actually diagnosed as
OL,11,Finfertile before falling pregnant with
OL,12,FRemy, so I thought, OK, I need to try
OL,13,Feverything in my power to go full
OL,14,Fterm."
OL,16,FDetermined to give her baby the best
OL,17,Fpossible start, Mia reached out to her
OL,18,Flocal NHS stop smoking service.
OL,26,@nD@KOUpD@]O]rD@AOUvD@FO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786493896
OL,3,CCheshire mum gave up smoking for a
OL,4,Chealthier family during prenancy
OL,6,FShe was given a nicotine inhalator to
OL,7,Fhelp with cravings, but it was the
OL,8,Fadvice from her support worker that
OL,9,Fmade the biggest impact.
OL,11,FMia said, "She explained that every
OL,12,Finhale you take of a cigarette is how
OL,13,Fthe oxygen reaches your baby, and from
OL,14,Fthat moment, it really hit me.
OL,16,F"I realised I was depriving my unborn
OL,17,Fchild of oxygen. She didn't have a
OL,18,Fchoice; everything I put in my body
OL,19,Fwould affect her.
OL,26,@sD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786493896
OL,3,CCheshire mum gave up smoking for a
OL,4,Chealthier family during prenancy
OL,6,F"That really put things into
OL,7,Fperspective and gave me the motivation
OL,8,Fto quit."
OL,10,FThough quitting wasn't easy, Mia
OL,11,Finsists it was worth it and her
OL,12,Fdaughter Remy Jean is thriving.
OL,14,FNHS figures for Cheshire and
OL,15,FMerseyside show progress, with the
OL,16,Fproportion of women smoking up to
OL,17,Fgiving birth falling to 4.8% in 2025/
OL,18,F26, down from 6.5% the previous year.
OL,26,@pD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
