OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786493896
OL,3,CCheshire mum gave up smoking for a
OL,4,Chealthier family during prenancy
OL,6,FAlmost two years after quitting, Mia
OL,7,Fremains smoke-free and is now
OL,8,Fexpecting another baby girl in the
OL,9,Fautumn.
OL,11,FHer advice to other mums who want to
OL,12,Fquit? "Definitely reach out. I think a
OL,13,Flot of women don't know where to get
OL,14,Fthe support from, but 100% speak to
OL,15,Fyour midwife or your GP, they can
OL,16,Frefer you to the right person for you."
OL,18,FSince quitting, Mia says she feels
OL,19,Fhealthier, has saved money, and is
OL,20,Fbuilding the best possible life for
OL,21,Fher growing family.
OL,26,@tD@GOUxD@gO]
